From 45e11cc5e009bf5255cd1405fda38165af37be29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thando <thando@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 20:46:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(clients): business/individual/NPO client entry with
 extended detail

- Client model gains client_type (business|individual|npo, default business)
  plus company_name, registration_number, tax_number, industry, website,
  billing_address, city, country, postal_code
- Validation: business/npo require company_name, individual requires
  first_name+last_name
- display_name property used consistently across activity logs, search,
  tags, CSV/PDF export and dashboards instead of raw first/last name
  concatenation

feat(projects): team assignment (individuals or departments) + extended detail

- New ProjectAssignment model/table: assign a project to one user or one
  department (exactly one), with an optional role label
- New endpoints: GET/POST /projects/{id}/assignments,
  DELETE /projects/{id}/assignments/{assignment_id}; duplicate assignments
  rejected
- Project gains optional objectives/deliverables/stakeholders/billing_notes
  fields for a 'Specify More' extended-detail section

- Alembic migration f9ab0648f636 (verified upgrade/downgrade/upgrade
  against a DB seeded at the prior head; resulting schema matches models)
- New tests/test_client_types_and_assignments.py (15 tests)
- Full backend suite: 139 passed (up from 124)
