From 36f9aced2f077b4a018279b255cf1f09f85e4a5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thando <thando@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 21:50:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(frontend): business/individual client form + project
 team assignment UI

Clients page:
- Client Type selector (business / npo / individual) drives conditional
  form fields: company name + primary contact for business/npo, first/last
  name for individual
- 'Specify More' toggle reveals registration number, tax number, industry,
  website, billing address, city, country, postal code for business/npo
  clients
- New shared clientName()/clientDisplayName() helper replaces raw
  first_name/last_name concatenation across clients, projects, tasks,
  files and reports pages so business clients display their company name
  everywhere instead of blank text

Projects page:
- New 'Team' tab: assign the engagement to an individual user or an
  entire department (with an optional role label), list current
  assignments, remove them
- New api.js helpers: fetchProjectAssignments/createProjectAssignment/
  deleteProjectAssignment
- 'Specify More' toggle on the create/edit engagement form reveals
  optional objectives/deliverables/stakeholders/billing notes fields,
  also shown read-only on the Overview tab when set

All changed files verified with an esbuild JSX syntax check.
